# The .NET images (Smx.Backend) use this whole `src/` tree as their build
# context. Without this, az acr build uploads every bin/obj/node_modules folder — build output the
# multi-stage Dockerfiles restore fresh anyway. (The frontend keeps its own smx-web/.dockerignore.)
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vs/
